      "name": "FOUR SHORES. ONE TABLE.",
      "description": "A personal expression of my love for Greece, Portugal, Jordan and the Levant.\nThis menu is not only about flavours. It is a story of culture, hospitality, and the warmth and generosity of the Mediterranean. Each dish brings together ingredients, traditions and memories from these shores, interpreted through my own culinary style.\nIt is food made to be shared, conversations to linger over, and a table that brings different cultures together.\nMEZZA\nAt the Heart of the Table",
